<title>UK: NWE gasoline steady, barges trade from $188 to $19.</title>
<headline>NWE gasoline steady, barges trade from $188 to $19.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE gasoline was steady on Monday, traders said.</p>
<p>A single trader sold Eurograde barges at $188 fob ARA, $189 fob AR and $191 fob ARA.</p>
<p>Dealers said cargo markets were quiet, with the arbitrage to the U.S. still closed and likely to bottle up barrels in Europe, further widening the spread between Regular and Eurograde gasoline.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
</text>
